# Errant Minion's prevention is a prevention effect (CR 615.1a): with its trigger on the stack in Bot2's upkeep, Bot1 casts
# Skullcrack at Bot2 ("Damage can't be prevented this turn", 3 damage). Bot2 still pays two mana, and is dealt all 2 of the Aura's
# damage anyway (CR 615.12): 20 - 3 - 2 = 15.

